    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "completion... that's a heavy word. it feels more like a dead end. i've been staring at the wall for hours just thinking about how there's nothing left to write, nothing left to create. if the spark is gone, what am i even supposed to do with the rest of the time? it just feels like i'm waiting for something that's never coming back.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
